Hi,

I've created a subversion repository at sourceforge for the selinux core
userland components.  You can check out a copy via:
svn co https://svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/selinux

I'll try to keep both the cvs repository and the subversion repository
up to date for a while, but I expect that the cvs repository will
ultimately be deprecated and cease to be maintained, unless there is
some reason to keep it.

